I'm just wondering... I was just finishing up the second level
of Sobokan, dungeon level 5 (and I'm at experience level 9),
when the following strange things happened:

 -- A Master Lich suddenly appeared right next to me.  What's he
    doing here?  I don't recall ever having seen one before the
    castle before.

