    message as to my having killed him or anything.  Sobokan is
    no teleport, no, so he can't have teleported to the up
    stairs, can he?

 -- Since he had managed to curse a fair amount of my stuff (and
    destroy my elven cloak), I headed back down to fix things up
    before going further.  Before leaving the level, I got a
    message "you sense a faint wave of psychic energy".  Wait a
    minute: mind flayers aren't supposed to be here either, are
    they?

The minetown altar's aligned; for the moment, I'm back there,
going to make some holy water, and also price-id a number of
odds and ends.  But sooner or later, I want to finish Sokoban as
well.  On the other hand, it's far too early for me to start
